    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaf560db819dd8ca61c1b401",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ええ勿論。実は、今もしておりますよ。\\n……フフ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "824cd2d12e58f4bd3f5e8902123266ca2a1ab8205366d3cfad9956be6fb6bba2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1286"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdcc1a23c97482781b96c1de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "そうですね……ゴミ掃除でしょうか。\\n綺麗好きなもので、目につくとつい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e21a2afb43ff85afc2113cc66f76977443f8efe7d605745f5572b0e72119919e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1287"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b826e3049b3e56056ddc090e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "眼鏡は必ず拭きますよ。曇っていては、\\n小石なんかを見落としてしまいますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa7c25fac3272091df44aa431092852a54f193e67be140c1c75c927b0db0c7db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1288"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05b14a22ab4e078690397658",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "妹や、美しいと思う方のレースを観ると、\\n自身も見合った走りをしようと思いますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a463cb712acab0febe38a95914ad9741a4930e5224a7f5e37ff33e4d639e356",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1289"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018ffcba1b5f32752f9840e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是谁说的！唔唔唔……\\n风风绝对不要最后一名孤独过终点啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2e3ca3ead5012a40ca51c3617ea7212925ca3ba0b4184c507a9cc4a8ba5e2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb7182c80a48cce5467b6548",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Have a safe trip.\\n足元に気をつけて、よき旅を。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b73903d9b087e55b4872ccddee4b6b0fd73869fcf563bc02896f00b50cf6f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1290"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a628f61ee7c1f7904a71e759",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "妹や、美しいと思う方のレースを観ると、\\n自身も見合った走りをしようと思いますね。",
