    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff936ce05bcc1ad023bdb5d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小栗前辈在睡着的情况下，把电子锅里的东西\\n全都吃光了呢。那光景让我很惊讶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "371f36b2ca83814cab9051d89b67a02c0cc625cf4775e6aaf6bd6194d2229dc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4f73430d613bb6836f8ef30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼～是魔法喔，魔、法！\\n今天的竞赛，我也会神奇地一飞冲天喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "342ac57011cabd77228d8c80b63c463b80fa51f4a85358d8c427b554c60c8dc9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a675dcb4c68bdb37a3700b7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超えるべきは自分のみ。見ていろ、私！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb3a495071ebb36193d73546368974a4ae93b5ca871f7ed7022f6e317ced5e65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1300"
      ]
    },
    {
