    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aebfd0500b4d49bb1e26f201",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "額縁に入れ愛でていては、ただの傍観者。\\n此方に手を伸ばさない限り。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d6b88d14070db141262619fa6a9728824b853fd7c89f59c2f63f03d34845dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5249f53fc4b363b7aa9c23c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ほほほ。カーフを鍛えるにはコツがあるの。\\nヒラメ筋と腓腹筋のワークアウトを（後略）",
      "source_fingerprint": "493d60918f05cbfd7690c6dae760fdd69c46787fb11e8a3c80490c858c063cc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7937312233cd3729487c3f5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "軽く走り、シャワーを浴びて、食事を。\\n力の資本は、体でしてよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b23f932634f90cad48a4254d16f0c6b014b90c968d88688c3f0fe53d716a7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935956a10803879264620cc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "額縁に入れ愛でていては、ただの傍観者。\\n此方に手を伸ばさない限り。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25d6b88d14070db141262619fa6a9728824b853fd7c89f59c2f63f03d34845dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1309"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6d00bf00613364fc7ee92a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是我伟大的魔女祖母喔。因为她过去\\n曾像骑着魔法扫帚般，轻松地跑完竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "967411f88e0dba13babf9f1c0c412e74feaf478ac87f1624a4cdd2402079e7a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df79c926d9ccb90e635984e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ほほほ。カーフを鍛えるにはコツがあるの。\\nヒラメ筋と腓腹筋のワークアウトを（後略）",
      "source_fingerprint": "493d60918f05cbfd7690c6dae760fdd69c46787fb11e8a3c80490c858c063cc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1310"
      ]
    },
    {
