      "source_text": "はい、いくつか。あらゆる展開を想定し、\\nそれぞれに戦略を用意しておりますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1d24bcc7a9b50f7c8c6650d67a2b3a4f535da87a01d004b7f5f7c6775e0cfa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e0894756c19b5c70be17d62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "食事、睡眠、鍛錬、全て疎かにできません。\\nあとは……親友との日向ぼっこでしょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a499096d7df5dd9af97f00c6817cbe946256a487d6addd521a21be133bfa64",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2668005b9b83097ed252ab16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "はい、トレーナーの好物をたくさん作って\\nさしあげようと♪　……あれ、違いました？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aafc4277e8b3e7d2e41f66c79b088bc310575f9c375e4e78a05f3288a09c9c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1327"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f27e02d814eb63008654952",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……メレンゲを、量産します。\\n単調な作業は、精神を安定させますので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f56d32d6f33331614de7876cbdc2fe7fc7b0b5b900d26bb2e55a5c3793cb2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:714d7160718e85e258615cf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "必ずや勝利し、“強さ”を示します。\\nそれをもって、未来の礎となるために。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1353c1ab61806b1abb97eb8e56e182395e4e71af24ac58b95224bbab93b332a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "1329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:183b7e5deebb4803b0a7510d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会宠爱大家♪帮忙打扫洗衣服或\\n任～何事情，然后……呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddf67917e864124fcfd2acdb7886f49e0885ca5ea9067dba437f4e907d2a2e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa58fd76d8049af351e3cdbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……メレンゲを、量産します。\\n単調な作業は、精神を安定させますので。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f56d32d6f33331614de7876cbdc2fe7fc7b0b5b900d26bb2e55a5c3793cb2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
